  assets/media/*.json og i appens «Bildekreditering». Disse lisensene gjelder for bildene.
  Photos under assets/media come from Wikimedia Commons under their own free licenses; the
  credits are in assets/media/*.json and in the app's "Image credits" screen.
- Landegrenser i assets/geo er fra Natural Earth (offentlig eiendom).
  Country borders in assets/geo are from Natural Earth (public domain).
